0</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ghost: <a href=\"#/monster/shade\">Shade</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/wraith\">Wraith</a> <span class=\"muted\">(29)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/c7ffc5d0340d5f1bcdfd.webp\" alt=\"Banshee\"></div><h3>Banshee</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>35 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–34)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ghost</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>freeze · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>152</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>23.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}